 with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s3","report_id":"test_006","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 24 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s4","report_id":"test_006","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s5","report_id":"test_006","text":"ViT-S outperforms VGG-16 by 8.4 percentage points on IMDB (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s6","report_id":"test_006","text":"As shown in Figure 1, Baseline reaches about 60% accuracy on IMDB.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s7","report_id":"test_006","text":"As shown in Figure 1, ViT-S reaches 76.0% accuracy on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s8","report_id":"test_006","text":"Figure 2 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s9","report_id":"test_006","text":"VGG-16 scores about 19 points higher on 40 than on 5 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s10","report_id":"test_006","text":"At epoch 5, VGG-16 achieves about 80% test accuracy (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s11","report_id":"test_006","text":"At epoch 5, VGG-16 achieves 76.6% test accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s12","report_id":"test_006","text":"From epoch 10 to epoch 20, the test accuracy of VGG-16 improves by a relative 8.4% (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s13","report_id":"test_006","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s14","report_id":"test_006","text":"As shown in Figure 3, LSTM achieves 101.4% F1 score on SST-2.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s15","report_id":"test_006","text":"ResNet-50 achieves 75.0% F1 score on MNIST (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s16","report_id":"test_006","text":"ResNet-50 achieves 72.2% F1 score on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s17","report_id":"test_006","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 74.3%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"test_006_s18","report_id":"test_006","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}